# The package's example is the singular `example/` dir (ivi-homescreen), per
# the pub layout convention. `examples/` holds the cross-compile manifest
# collection wired into CI (`emb matrix examples/cross`) and the docs; it stays
# browsable on GitHub but is not shipped in the published archive. Pub only
# recognizes a singular `example/`, so shipping the plural dir trips a layout
# warning — and the manifests add weight without being package API.
examples/
